[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-makerere-university-mastercard-scholarship-for-africans-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-89":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},89,"makerere-university-mastercard-scholarship-for-africans-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-89","Makerere University Mastercard Scholarship For Africans 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>The Makerere University Mastercard Foundation Scholarship in Uganda presents a fully funded opportunity for African students to pursue higher education on one of the best institutions on the continent.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Makerere University Mastercard Scholarship 2026 Abstract\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Mastercard Foundation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Study Abroad: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-africa\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Study-In-Africa\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Uganda\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fundergraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Undergraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F?utm_source=Google&amp;utm_medium=Catergory&amp;utm_campaign=Email+Campaign\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel Costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Laptop\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: African Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: June 5, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Makerere University Mastercard Scholarship for Africans 2026 Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Makerere University is pleased to announce the second Cohort of Undergraduate and Master’s scholarship opportunities for students joining Makerere University main campus in the Academic Year 2025\u002F2026. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Mastercard Foundation Scholars Program at Makerere University will provide 1000 scholarships for 10 years at both the undergraduate (Bachelor’s degree) and graduate levels at the main campus.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Makerere University Mastercard Scholarships are awarded to academically talented young men and women from Sub-Saharan Africa experiencing financial hardship to pursue university education.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Makerere University Mastercard Scholarship in Uganda 2026 Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Mastercard Scholarship offers the following to its beneficiaries;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full tuition fees\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation in a UP residence\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Meals\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Books and printed material\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A modest monthly stipend\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical aid\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel costs (one return trip for the duration of the study period)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Cost of one visa application for the duration of the study period.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Available Programmes for Mastercard Scholarship at Makerere University\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>For the 2025\u002F26 academic session, the MMastercard Scholarship at Makerere University are awarded for courses ranging from the College of arts, environmental sciences, natural sciences, law, health sciences, social sciences, to engineering.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Makerere University Mastercard Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the undergraduate and postgraduate Makerere University Mastercard Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>have applied for admission to Makerere University’s main campus for the academic year 2025\u002F2026.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>must have either;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Completed their advanced secondary level education\u002Fundergraduate in an African country or\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold second class\u002Fcredit diploma from any recognized institution or\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Must have passed the mature age entry of Makerere University \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>should be experiencing financial hardships.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>should not be a holder of any other scholarship, including the Government of Uganda Scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>should not have completed any undergraduate or postgraduate degree Programme.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>should have demonstrated leadership potential and\u002For community service.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>should be 28 years old or younger (35 years for Masters applicants) at the time of the application deadline. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fapply.mastercardfoundation.mak.ac.ug\u002Fscholarships\">https:\u002F\u002Fapply.mastercardfoundation.mak.ac.ug\u002Fscholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-03-21 13:02:07",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmakerere-university-mastercard-scholarship-for-africans-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69be88bf8f4948.87047590_screenshot 2026-03-21 125539.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fmakerere-university-mastercard-scholarship-for-africans-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69be88bf8f4948.87047590_screenshot%202026-03-21%20125539.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fu